<h1>Privacy Policy – The Shaken Circle</h1>

<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> June 2026</p>

<p>
The Shaken Circle ("the App") is a storytelling experience designed for children
aged 6–8. The App encourages creativity through a ritual inspired by traditional
Neapolitan playing cards. By shaking the device, children receive a character,
an emotion, and an obstacle that become the foundation of an original story.
</p>

<p>
The App was created and developed by <strong>Bianca De Vivo</strong>,
winner of the <strong>Swift Student Challenge 2026</strong>.
</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
The Shaken Circle does not collect, store, process, sell, or share any personal
information from users.
</p>

<p>The App:</p>

<ul>
<li>Does not require user registration.</li>
<li>Does not require account creation.</li>
<li>Does not collect names, email addresses, phone numbers, or home addresses.</li>
<li>Does not collect location data.</li>
<li>Does not use analytics or tracking tools.</li>
<li>Does not display advertisements.</li>
<li>Does not use cookies.</li>
<li>Does not share information with third parties.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
Protecting children's privacy is a fundamental goal of The Shaken Circle.
The App is designed to be safe for young users and does not knowingly collect
any personal information from children.
</p>

<h2>Stories and Drawings</h2>

<p>
Users may create stories and drawings within the App.
Any content created by users remains stored locally on the device unless the
user chooses to export or share it using features provided by the operating system.
</p>

<p>
The developer cannot access, view, collect, or store any stories, drawings,
or creative content created within the App.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
The App does not use third-party advertising networks, marketing platforms,
or tracking services.
</p>

<h2>Data Security</h2>

<p>
Because the App does not collect or transmit personal information,
there is no personal user data stored on external servers by the developer.
</p>

<h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>
This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time.
Any future modifications will be reflected by updating the date shown at the
top of this document.
</p>

